Silo patch 0021 — mmdevapi (DualSense, from MacGameFix)

Origin: MacGameFix (https://github.com/MathiasKowoll/MacGameFix) engine/patches/wine-11.0/0003-mmdevapi.patch (Mathias Kowoll,
LGPL-2.1-or-later, the Wine modules' license; MacGameFix at da9c470, 2026-11-25). Code unchanged. MacGameFix's series
0001-0016 is Silo's 0019-0034, in the same order; 0035 moves its settings and logs into Silo's own folders.

What it does (mmdevapi.dll), as MacGameFix's engine/README.md says:
  The property store asks the driver for an active endpoint's container instead of reading the registry, which
  cannot hold a GUID and would keep it after the device is gone.

Checked here: the whole series applies after 0002-0018 with no fuzz; built with the runtime's flags and played on
2026-11-26 with a DualSense over Bluetooth, Steam Input off, from Steam for macOS: UNCHARTED (input, trigger effects,
rumble on the actuators) and The Last of Us Part II.

